SUMMARY:"Growing Our Future" -Graton Community Club Flower Show + Plant Sale
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Friday and Saturday\, October 16-17\, from 9am-4pm (both days) for the Graton Community Club’s Fall Flower Show & Plant Sale as we HONOR CHILDREN everywhere! Invite your friends\, family and neighbors. All are welcome\, always FREE admission.  Enjoy live music\, plants\, luncheon\, coffee and desserts\, raffle prizes\, white elephant gifts\, quilts\, garden art\, homemade novelties and crafts… something for everyone!\nHAVE EXTRA ART + CRAFT SUPPLIES?\nNEW THIS TIME! At this Flower Show\, we will be accepting donations of gently used or new art and craft supplies. Now is a good time to look through your studios\, closets\, art/craft boxes. We’ll have donation boxes in the main hall\, and anything you’d like to donate is appreciated! We will later deliver these art/craft supplies to the wonderful art teachers at our local schools\, Oak Grove and Willowside. Thank you!\nADA accessible and child friendly.  The Club is a nonprofit 501(c) 3\, tax ID #94-6093957. Since 1954\, sales have benefited local student scholarships.   Your continued support over the years is greatly appreciated!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/growing-our-future-graton-community-club-flower-show-plant-sale/2026-10-16/1/
LOCATION:Graton Community Club\, 8996 Graton Road\, Graton\, CA\, 95444\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly),Food & Drink,Free,Fundraiser,Gardening/Agriculture,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/growingourfuture-oct16-17-copy.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="Graton Community Club":MAILTO:kessel@sonic.net
END:VEVENT
