SUMMARY:Velvet's Mini Burlesque Variety Show
DESCRIPTION:Sebastopol’s resident burlesque dancer Velvet Thorn is going to Japan this November! She needs your help to get to Kobe for the Japan International Burlesque Festival. What better way to raise some support for her travels than doing what she knows best: putting on a show!\nOn October 16th at The Main Street Theater Sebastopol enjoy an evening of burlesque performances from artists across the Bay Area! There will also be a costume sale in the lobby and Velvet Thorn merch available.\nVelvet has been producing burlesque shows for over a year across SOCO. If you have enjoyed any productions from Epineux Productions or come to support her at another local show\, or you are interested to see what burlesque is all about drop by for an evening of community fun!\nLobby opens at 6:45pm\, Theater opens at 7:00pm\, and Show at 7:30pm
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/velvets-mini-burlesque-variety-show/
LOCATION:104 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 104 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 94931
CATEGORIES:Adults, generally,Dance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Velvet-Mini-Poster-October-16th.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Epineux":MAILTO:epine.velvet@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
