SUMMARY:Voter Information Night
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for Voter Information Night on Tuesday\, October 20 from 6-8pm in the Analy Library and Cafeteria. Analy Government students have been working hard to create presentations that give you the facts about each of the propositions and what a Yes or No vote means for each. Don’t miss this chance ​to ​help you make a more informed decision as you cast your ballot come November!
