SUMMARY:Lobster Bash
DESCRIPTION:Music\, Dinner\, Dancing\, Raffle\, Live and Silent Auctions. Dinner includes the freshest 1-1/2 lb lobster plus shrimp\, sausages\, potatoes\, corn\, leeks\, salad\, dessert and appetizers. Wine\, beer & cocktails included. \nThis is Sebastopol Rotary club’s major Fundraising event of our 102nd year. Help to support youth leadership\, scholarship\, and other educational programs such as Mark Sell Teacher Grants\, Learn to Swim for second graders in West Sonoma County\, Cool Kids Camp for physically or emotionally abused children 8-12 years old\, and much more!! This fundraiser helps to support community projects such as the 2024 rebuilding of the Willard Libby Park duck pond fence. \nEarly bird special; get your tickets by October 1\, 2026\, and save $10 on each tickets. Sebastopol Rotary puts the FUN in fundraising. \nCall Cindy Carter at 408-431-7820 to answer any questions you may have\, reserve a ticket or table for 8. Or\, go to www.sebastopolrotary.com for tickets.
