SUMMARY:Restorative Yamuna Body Rolling with Jacque Benton
DESCRIPTION:Register HERE for this popular monthly Yamuna class. Instructor for October is Jacque Benton \nRestorative Yamuna Body Rolling (YBR) releases tension in the body while creating strength and flexibility. Using a Yamuna ball\, we will anatomically roll through tight and misaligned muscles. This creates Body Sustainability by working out stiffness and improves range of motion by creating space in the body. YBR can help prevent injuries and heal breakdowns. \nABOUT YOUR INSTRUCTOR \nJacque Benton has been teaching weekly Yamuna Body Rolling classes since 2004.\nPracticing Massage therapy for over 20 years & teaching Yoga\, combined with a fascination with anatomy\, fuels Jacque’s passion for teaching Yamuna.\nJacque is a certified Yamuna Teacher Trainer and holds annual trainings in the area.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/jacque-benton-yamuna/
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center\, 120 PLeasant Hill Ave. N\, Suite 330\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens,Adults, generally,Education,Exercise/Yoga,Health,Older adults generally, 60+,Participatory,Physical exercise
